tion">Figure 14: conceptual overview of the sequence-mixing convolution</fi=
gcaption></figure></div><p></p><p>Next to the sequence mixing shown in Figu=
re 13, there is also a channel mixing component. It=E2=80=99s in principle =
similar though, so I am omitting the illustration.</p><p><span>CCA appears =
to be a Zyphra-introduced attention mechanism that predates the </span><a h=
ref=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05365">ZAYA1-8B technical report</a><span=
>. The standalone CCA paper, </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.0=
4476">Compressed Convolutional Attention: Efficient Attention in a Compress=
