introduces CCA. ZAYA1-8B then uses this mechanism as one of the core pieces=
.</span></p><p>But the question is, =E2=80=9Cis it better than MLA=E2=80=9D=
? According to the CCA paper=E2=80=99s own experiments, yes, they report CC=
A outperforming MLA under comparable compression settings.</p><div class=3D=
