ing) adds only 6.7% additional training time overhead for 4 residual stream=
s (n =3D 4) throughout all transformer blocks compared to the single-stream=
 baseline.</p><p>To sum up this section, HC/mHC changes how information is =
carried around these layers by replacing the single residual stream with se=
veral interacting residual streams, with the additional stability constrain=
ts added in mHC, while adding minimal compute overhead. Also, it pairs well=
